@startuml 使用案例3_1: 申請列表瀏覽
title 使用案例3.1: 申請列表瀏覽

actor "審核者" as User
participant "ApplicationReview.vue" as ApplicationReviewPage
participant "applications.ts" as ApplicationAPI
participant "applications.py(blueprint)" as ApplicationBlueprint
participant "application_service.py" as ApplicationService
participant "application.py(model)" as ApplicationModel
participant "animal.py(model)" as AnimalModel
participant "user.py(model)" as UserModel
database "MySQL" as DB

== 1. 進入申請管理頁面 ==
User -> ApplicationReviewPage: 訪問 /application-review
activate ApplicationReviewPage
ApplicationReviewPage -> ApplicationReviewPage: onMounted()
note right
  角色說明:
  - ADMIN: 可查看所有申請
  - SHELTER_MEMBER: 查看收容所動物申請
  - GENERAL_MEMBER: 查看個人動物申請
end note

== 2. 載入申請列表 ==
ApplicationReviewPage -> ApplicationAPI: getApplications(filters)
activate ApplicationAPI
note right
  filters:
  - mode: 'review' (固定使用審核模式)
  - status: 狀態篩選 (all/PENDING/UNDER_REVIEW/APPROVED/REJECTED)
  - animal_id: 特定動物 (從 URL query 參數)
  - page: 頁碼
  - per_page: 每頁筆數 (預設 10)
  
  註: ApplicationReview.vue 固定使用 review 模式
  其他模式 (my/all) 用於 MyApplications.vue
end note
ApplicationAPI -> ApplicationBlueprint: GET /applications
activate ApplicationBlueprint

ApplicationBlueprint -> ApplicationBlueprint: @jwt_required()\\n取得 current_user_id
ApplicationBlueprint -> UserModel: User.query.get(current_user_id)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id=?
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: 使用者資料
deactivate DB
UserModel --> ApplicationBlueprint: User 物件
deactivate UserModel

ApplicationBlueprint -> ApplicationService: list_applications(current_user, filters)
activate ApplicationService

== 3. 權限過濾邏輯 ==
ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 基礎查詢\\nApplication.query.filter_by(deleted_at=None)

alt user.role == ADMIN
  ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 管理員可查看所有申請
  note right
    無額外過濾條件
  end note
else user.role != ADMIN
  ApplicationService -> AnimalModel: 查詢使用者擁有的動物
  activate AnimalModel
  
  ApplicationService -> AnimalModel: 1. 查詢個人送養動物
  AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT animal_id FROM animals\\nWHERE owner_id=? AND deleted_at IS NULL
  activate DB
  DB --> AnimalModel: personal_animals[]
  deactivate DB
  AnimalModel --> ApplicationService: owned_animal_ids[]
  
  alt user.role == SHELTER_MEMBER AND primary_shelter_id 存在
    ApplicationService -> AnimalModel: 2. 查詢收容所動物
    AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT animal_id FROM animals\\nWHERE shelter_id=? AND deleted_at IS NULL
    activate DB
    DB --> AnimalModel: shelter_animals[]
    deactivate DB
    AnimalModel --> ApplicationService: 加入 owned_animal_ids[]
  end
  deactivate AnimalModel
  
  ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 應用 review 模式過濾
  note right
    mode='review': 僅顯示別人對自己動物的申請
    filter(animal_id IN owned_animal_ids)
    
    註: 其他模式 (my/all) 在此圖中不適用
    ApplicationReview.vue 固定使用 review 模式
    MyApplications.vue 使用 my 或 all 模式
  end note
end

== 4. 應用其他篩選條件 ==
alt 有 status 篩選
  ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: query.filter_by(status=?)
end

alt 有 animal_id 篩選
  ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: query.filter_by(animal_id=?)
end

alt 有 applicant_id 篩選
  ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 檢查權限
  note right
    非管理員只能查詢自己的申請
  end note
  ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: query.filter_by(applicant_id=?)
end

== 5. 執行查詢並返回 ==
ApplicationService -> ApplicationModel: query.order_by(created_at DESC).paginate(...)
activate ApplicationModel
ApplicationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM applications\\nWHERE ... ORDER BY created_at DESC\\nLIMIT ? OFFSET ?
activate DB
note right
  包含所有篩選條件和分頁
  JOIN 相關資料:
  - applicant (User)
  - animal (Animal)
  - assignee (User)
end note
DB --> ApplicationModel: applications[]
deactivate DB
ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: pagination 物件
deactivate ApplicationModel

ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 組裝回應
note right
  {
    items: [app.to_dict(include_relations=True)],
    total: pagination.total,
    page: page,
    per_page: per_page,
    pages: pagination.pages
  }
end note
ApplicationService --> ApplicationBlueprint: {items[], pagination}
deactivate ApplicationService

ApplicationBlueprint --> ApplicationAPI: 200 OK + {items[], pagination}
deactivate ApplicationBlueprint
ApplicationAPI --> ApplicationReviewPage: {applications[], pagination}
deactivate ApplicationAPI

ApplicationReviewPage -> ApplicationReviewPage: 更新畫面\\napplications.value = response.items
ApplicationReviewPage -> ApplicationReviewPage: 計算統計卡片數據
note right
  統計從前端已載入的申請計算:
  - pending: filter(status === 'PENDING').length
  - underReview: filter(status === 'UNDER_REVIEW').length
  - approved: filter(status === 'APPROVED').length
  - rejected: filter(status === 'REJECTED').length
  
  註: 統計數字反映當前頁面數據,非全部總數
end note
ApplicationReviewPage --> User: 顯示申請列表 (含統計卡片)
deactivate ApplicationReviewPage

== 6. 替代流程 - 篩選切換 ==
opt 使用者切換篩選
  User -> ApplicationReviewPage: 點擊篩選標籤 (全部/待審核/審核中/已通過/已拒絕)
  activate ApplicationReviewPage
  ApplicationReviewPage -> ApplicationReviewPage: changeFilter(filter)
  ApplicationReviewPage -> ApplicationReviewPage: currentFilter.value = filter
  ApplicationReviewPage -> ApplicationReviewPage: pagination.page = 1 (重置頁碼)
  ApplicationReviewPage -> ApplicationReviewPage: fetchApplications() (使用新篩選)
  note right: 回到步驟 2 重新載入列表
  ApplicationReviewPage --> User: 顯示篩選後的申請
  deactivate ApplicationReviewPage
end

note over User, DB
  **後置條件:**
  1. 申請列表已載入並顯示 (含權限過濾)
  2. 列表資料已正確分頁
  3. 統計卡片已更新 (從前端數據計算,反映當前頁面)
  
  **權限控制:**
  - 管理員: 查看所有申請
  - 送養人: 查看自己動物的申請
  - 收容所會員: 查看所屬收容所動物的申請
  
  **查詢模式 (ApplicationReview.vue):**
  - 固定使用 review 模式: 別人對自己動物的申請
  - 其他模式在不同頁面:
    - my 模式: MyApplications.vue (自己提交的申請)
    - all 模式: 需要時可用 (自己申請 OR 自己動物的申請)
  
  **篩選功能:**
  - status: all, PENDING, UNDER_REVIEW, APPROVED, REJECTED
  - animal_id: 特定動物的申請 (從 URL query)
  - applicant_id: 特定申請人 (限管理員,此頁面不使用)
  - 分頁: page (切換篩選時重置為 1), per_page (預設 10)
end note

@enduml